          "@value": "Allen’s interval algebra relation 'meets' (OWL-Time time:intervalMeets). For TimeSeriesSegment individuals, inferable via :segmentIndex: A ends exactly when B starts, with no overlap.",
          "@language": "en"
        }
      ],
      "rdfs:domain": [
        {
