          "@value": "Allen’s interval algebra relation 'overlappedBy' (OWL-Time time:intervalOverlappedBy). Inverse of :overlaps. For TimeSeriesSegment individuals, inferable via :segmentIndex: A is overlapped by B.",
          "@language": "en"
